{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_02077b6f680e7786-1690\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>秋天到了，氣候逐漸變得乾燥，此時的養生重點在於「防秋燥」！其中，杏仁是非常適合秋季食用的滋補食材。《最強生命線》請來註冊中醫師何潔儀，為大家詳細拆解「苦杏仁（北杏）」與「甜杏仁（南杏）」的功效差異、挑選指南及食用禁忌，更推介一款適合秋日飲用的清熱潤燥養生糖水！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_02077b6f680e7786-1691\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>何潔儀中醫師指出，杏仁主要分為「苦杏仁」與「甜杏仁」兩種，兩者在功效與食用禁忌上各有不同：</span></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"97d0f8f6-1632-48e7-90e5-ff8cb994a0d5.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026mHO1Kbx0Ko1790156320.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"97d0f8f6-1632-48e7-90e5-ff8cb994a0d5.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"23d19dd6-f2f5-42b9-a8c2-420112c8a2b2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026nuLtRXGnOg1790156320.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"23d19dd6-f2f5-42b9-a8c2-420112c8a2b2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_02077b6f680e7786-1694\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>在日常煮食或煲湯時，一般都會將南北杏搭配一同使用。杏仁特別適合出現咳嗽氣喘、胸悶痰多，以及因秋燥引致腸燥便秘的人士食用。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_02077b6f680e7786-1695\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>雖然杏仁滋補，但何潔儀中醫師提醒，並非所有人都適合食用杏仁：</span></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li></ul><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_02077b6f680e7786-1698\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>購買杏仁時，應選擇顆粒均勻飽滿、形態完整、表面乾燥的產品，並注意檢查是否無霉變、無硫磺味及無其他異味。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_02077b6f680e7786-1699\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>在這個乾燥的時節，不妨在家輕鬆煲製這款能清熱潤燥、潤腸通便的養生糖水，非常適合秋天乾燥及有咳嗽症狀的人士飲用。（注意：若屬於脾胃虛弱且伴有咳嗽、吐稀白痰等「寒咳」現象者，應避免繼續食用。）</span></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cd3bf27b-2f0a-46df-b8ed-53b8bacbb533.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026BAD4bBqYGZ1790156319.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cd3bf27b-2f0a-46df-b8ed-53b8bacbb533.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\";'>**</span>本節目內主持及嘉賓的言論純屬個人意見並不代表本台立場。此內容僅供參考。如需獲得醫療意見或診斷，請諮詢專業人士。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T06:58:01.137643+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":474,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}